<title>SPAIN: Bank of Spain cut its key money rate to 6.00 %.</title>
<headline>Bank of Spain cut its key money rate to 6.00 %.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain said it cut its key money rate to 6.00 percent from 6.25 percent at today's regular repurchase tender for central bank certificates.</p>
</text>
